{
  "info": {
    "name": "NGOConnect API v5.0",
    "description": "NGO Connect Platform — Full API Collection v5.0\nReleased: 2026-08-05\nAbsorbs all patches applied to Railway staging through 2026-08-05.\n\nNew in v5.0:\n- Impact Summary (7 result sets)\n- Communication Preferences\n- Share Tokens & Public Resolvers\n- Support Contact\n- Certificates (issue + public verify)\n- Skill Ratings (per-project)\n- Org Invitations (8 endpoints)\n- Campaign Recipients (device ack)\n- Marketing Campaigns (Super Admin CRUD)\n- Membership Request Cancel\n- Application Withdraw\n- Saved Posts\n- Post Bulk Notify Org",
